cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DRE Visualizations"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An Omeka S module that adds interactive visualizations to resource and site
  pages: a draggable d3-force knowledge graph, per-entity dashboards of ECharts
  charts, and MapLibre GL maps. Data is pre-computed in PHP inside Omeka and
  served as static JSON, so the front end has no external service dependency and
  the release archive is self-contained. Built for the Africa Multiple Cluster of
  Excellence's Digital Research Environment (AMIRA).
